So you decided to explore this idea not just among your students but more broadly. And in fact, one of these case studies I think might encapsulate really well the ideas you're talking about. I want you to describe a few of these case stories to me. A young man whom you call Todd told you he grew up in Atlanta telling me the circumstances of Todd's childhood. Todd grew up in predominantly African-American Lewin gum neighborhood of Atlanta and he grew up with his mom who was in and out of work and with his grandparents and his grandparents home. His whole family

