So they lied to get Todd to go to this different school and Todd's life changed pretty dramatically at that point. The school offered him academic opportunities that he didn't have at his local public school. Most of the people that he went to school with were middle class, or upper middle class, the sons and daughters of doctors and dentists, and so on. And everybody at this school was college bound, which was not true at his public school. And sometimes started living kind of two lives.

