00:12:43.000 --> 00:13:10.000
He would go to the suburban magnet school and have friends who were more ethnically diverse. His school had been as he described it 100% black. The school was, there were a lot of white students, much wealthier students, more academic opportunities. And then he would come home and be back in his neighborhood and Todd described kind of feeling sometimes ashamed opportunities, and then he would come home and be back in his neighborhood and taught the scribe kind of feeling sometimes ashamed about where he came from and hiding

