00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:40.000
that from his school friends and his school friends parents. Todd eventually picked up basically from his friends how to apply to college and was the first person in his family to go to college. While at college taught lived where he went to college, but he would still go back home. So he was writing distance from home. He would still go back home and visit his grandparents and try to stay connected to his community.

