00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:49.000
Why was that? Yeah, so Todd got a prestigious internship with a federal government and moved to the Northeast. He was so calm to talk to his sister especially, but those conversations got very difficult because his sister was always complaining about not sending enough money home. So Todd had started to send money back to his family as soon as he started working. But his sister thought it was never enough. And so the conversations got very tense and it would make it hard for Todd to want to call his sister because he thought we're going to have another argument

