make more money and get a better job by doing so. Well, once you started working on the book, one of your best students whom you call Carlos was eager to tell you his story. And some of this had to do with a very troubling series of events involving his brother. Tell me what Carlos told you, Jennifer. He had the kind of story that a lot of other drivers have.

