someone valuable when the striver moved away or when those relationships were fractured by the stress of upward mobility. Mm-hmm. And so I wonder what the family think about that and what the members of the community that stay back think about having lost someone in this way. And, you know, we talk about this idea sometimes in the context of migration where we say, you know, that we call this brain drain.

